      "correspondence": "Lift a class of the finite kernel to x, then correct it by t x′ if λ(x)=tλ(x′). Both cokernel models quotient Y by B+tY. Finite local invariant groups give a common exponent killing the local H² product. The model x↦3x from ℤ/27 to ℤ/9 isolates the first level where lifting fails.",
